* mqoperator (MQWebUser) grants for {{ qm_name }} — epic .github#341 spec §2.2 / IBM S15 (#1501).
* Arm-agnostic; every QM-bearing play applies it once on the running QM (HA/DR replicate it).
* SET AUTHREC takes effect immediately, so no REFRESH SECURITY is needed. Every line must
* succeed: the applying task accepts runmqsc rc 0 only, so a refused grant fails loud.
{% for g in authz_mqoperator_grants %}
{% if g.objtype == 'QMGR' %}
SET AUTHREC OBJTYPE(QMGR) GROUP('mqoperator') AUTHADD({{ g.authadd }})
{% else %}
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('{{ g.profile }}') OBJTYPE({{ g.objtype }}) GROUP('mqoperator') AUTHADD({{ g.authadd }})
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
